{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cat_external","type":"text","text":"# 4. 外部表示、RAG 与 Agentic Video Search\n\n这一类不一定直接压缩 visual tokens，而是把视频组织成可检索、可展开、可检查的外部证据结构。\n\n- [[Paper/raw/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid.md|VideoTree]] 🟢⭐：query-adaptive tree representation；coarse-to-fine 展开 relevant keyframes / clips，caption 后交给 LLM 推理。\n- [[Paper/raw/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand.md|Deep Video Discovery / DVD]] 🟢⭐：构建 multi-granular video database；agent 用 Global Browse、Clip Search、Frame Inspect 工具在 observe-reason-act loop 中搜证。\n- [[Paper/raw/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question.md|HiCrew]] 🟢⭐：shot boundary 保 temporal topology，question-aware captioning + planning layer + multi-agent collaboration。\n- [[Paper/raw/threading-keyframe-with-narratives-mllms-as-strong-long-video-comprehenders/threading-keyframe-with-narratives-mllms-as-strong-long-video-comprehenders.md|Nar-KFC / Threading Keyframe with Narratives]] 🟢⭐：少量 keyframes + narratives 补回稀疏采样造成的时序断点。\n- [[Paper/raw/k-frames-scene-driven-any-k-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding/k-frames-scene-driven-any-k-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding.md|K-frames]] 也可放在此处：它预测连续 key clips 与 rationale，再从 clip 内抽帧，兼具 selector 与外部语义结构。\n\n**优势**：适合 ultra-long video、复杂时序/因果推理、可解释 evidence timeline。\n\n**风险**：caption bottleneck、文本化损失、agent 成本和稳定性、工具/数据库错误级联。\n\n**和 token 压缩的关系**：外部表示解决“如何组织长视频证据”，token 压缩解决“LLM 前 visual token 太多”。二者可以互补，但不是同一个问题。","x":-4585,"y":3330,"width":1050,"height":830,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cat_stream","type":"text","text":"# 6. Streaming / Dense Caption / 事件结构化支线\n\n这条线与离线 long-form MC VideoQA 有交集，但目标函数不同。\n\n- [[Paper/实时视频描述/LiveCC.md|LiveCC]]：面向流式实时解说。强调 causal streaming、ASR + frames 的 dense interleaving、低延迟响应。\n- [[Paper/实时视频描述/Dense-Captioning Events in Videos.md|Dense-Captioning Events in Videos / DDVC]]：事件定位 + dense caption，强调事件边界和描述质量，但通常需要完整视频，非实时。\n- [[Paper/raw/stay-in-your-lane-role-specific-queries-with-overlap-suppression-loss-for/stay-in-your-lane-role-specific-queries-with-overlap-suppression-loss-for.md|ROS-DVC]]：role-specific queries + overlap suppression，解决 DVC 中 localization/caption query 的干扰和重复事件。\n- [[Paper/raw/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language.md|Video-ChatGPT]]：开放式视频对话/描述评测，对 generation quality 有启发。\n\n**与 VideoQA 压缩路线的关系**：\n- 可借鉴 event boundary、event-level memory、online constraint；\n- 但不能直接替代 EgoSchema / Video-MME 的 evidence selection 与 reasoning；\n- 如果要做实时长视频理解，可考虑“LiveCC 的 streaming 输入 + DDVC 的事件结构 + VideoQA evidence routing”。","x":-3535,"y":-2590,"width":1020,"height":730,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"# 图例 / 读法\n\n- 🟢 training-free / plug-and-play\n- 🟡 需要训练轻量模块或访问中间状态\n- 🔴 需要训练/改 VLM forward/强绑定 backbone\n- ⭐ 强 query-aware / option-aware\n- ⚪ 主要是 query-agnostic 去冗余\n- ⚠️ 主要风险：early discard、caption bottleneck、option bias、工程复杂度\n\n阅读建议：先看中间的 pipeline，再顺着每个分类块的“代表论文 → 核心思想 → 风险”。","x":400,"y":-1860,"width":620,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cat_bg","type":"text","text":"# 0. 基础模型、任务与 Benchmark\n\n这组论文定义了 Video-LLM 的基础形态、数据/评测协议和任务边界。\n\n- [[Paper/raw/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language.md|Video-ChatGPT]]：早期 video conversation / video QA 模型。冻结 CLIP 与 Vicuna，仅训练 projection，把 temporal + spatial video features 接到 LLM；同时构造 100K video instruction pairs。适合作为“Video-LLM 如何起步”的基线。\n- [[Paper/文本视频/TOPA.md|TOPA]]：Text-only pre-alignment，用文本模拟视频时序。启发是语言时序预对齐；局限是缺真实 motion / spatial continuity，更多像语言时间逻辑而非真实视觉时序理解。\n- [[Paper/raw/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders.md|Video-MME-v2]]：Benchmark 路线。核心是 800 videos / 3,200 QA、8 options、tri-level capability hierarchy，以及 group-based non-linear evaluation；提醒不要只看单题 accuracy。\n- [[Paper/实时视频描述/LiveCC.md|LiveCC]] 与 [[Paper/实时视频描述/Dense-Captioning Events in Videos.md|Dense-Captioning Events in Videos / DDVC]]：streaming / dense event captioning 任务线索；更偏实时解说和事件结构化，不等同于离线 long-form MC VideoQA。\n- [[Paper/raw/stay-in-your-lane-role-specific-queries-with-overlap-suppression-loss-for/stay-in-your-lane-role-specific-queries-with-overlap-suppression-loss-for.md|ROS-DVC]]：Dense Video Captioning 内部 query/decoder 设计，和 VideoQA token compression 不在同一主线，但可借鉴 event localization / caption de-dup。\n\n**分类结论**：\n- Video-ChatGPT 是“模型/数据起点”；Video-MME-v2 是“评测目标升级”；TOPA/LiveCC/DDVC 是相邻任务和数据路线。\n- 若你的目标是 EgoSchema / NExT-QA / Video-MME，核心仍应放在 evidence selection、token budget 和 reasoning，而不是 text-only 或纯 DVC。","x":-5180,"y":-585,"width":980,"height":770,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"central","type":"text","text":"# Video Understanding 论文分类总结\n\n更新时间：2026-05-27  \n范围：`Paper/` 下与 video understanding / long-video QA / video-LLM / DVC 相关的论文笔记。\n\n**一句话总览**：研究重心已经从“把更多帧塞进 LLM”转向 **在有限 token / latency / context 预算下组织最小充分证据**。\n\n本白板按两条轴整理：\n1. **Pipeline 位置**：选帧 → 特征/语义抽取 → token 压缩 → 内部 memory/routing → 外部检索/agent → 推理/评测。\n2. **研究路线**：training-free frame selection、image-VLM→video adaptation、query-adaptive budget、agentic search、reasoning/calibration、streaming/DVC。\n\n已有线性综述：[[Paper/Video Understanding 论文综述报告.md|Video Understanding 论文综述报告]]，pipeline 版：[[Paper/视频理解/视频理解论文_Pipeline.md|视频理解论文 Pipeline]]。","x":-1700,"y":-400,"width":1480,"height":400,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"insight","type":"text","text":"# 总结性判断：哪些方向最值得继续做？\n\n## 1. 不要把“query-aware”放得太早\nKTV 的 semantic trap、DIG 的 GQ/LQ route、以及你已有笔记中的 DYTO/KTV 实验都指向同一个结论：\n\n> 早期时间覆盖最好尽量保持多样性和代表性；query/option-aware 更适合放在 evidence routing、token budget 或 reasoning 层。\n\n## 2. 压缩要拆成四类，不要混为一谈\n- 时间压缩：选帧/选 segment。\n- 外部语义压缩：caption/tree/database。\n- 输入侧 token 压缩：LLM 前 visual tokens。\n- 内部压缩：attention/KV/layer/memory。\n\n## 3. EgoSchema/Video-MME 的瓶颈不只是“看没看到”\nD-CoDe、HiCrew、DVD、C2R 都说明：长视频 QA 中“如何消费证据”常常和“是否保留证据”一样重要。\n\n## 4. 建议的研究主线\n**Option-Contrast Evidence Gathering**：\n1. 先构建 question-agnostic 的 coverage index；\n2. 把每个 option 当作 hypothesis；\n3. 分别检索 support / refute evidence；\n4. 对高争议片段分配更高视觉 token budget；\n5. 最后用 timestamp-bound evidence 做答案选择和校准。\n\n可直接连接现有笔记：[[Paper/视频理解/DYTO vs D-CoDe.md|DYTO vs D-CoDe]]、[[Paper/视频理解/DIG vs VideoRouter.md|DIG vs VideoRouter]]。","x":-1920,"y":1945,"width":1300,"height":850,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cat_reason","type":"text","text":"# 5. 推理、校准与评测：答案是否真的可靠？\n\n这一层不一定看更多视频，而是处理 **已有证据如何被消费、答案是否被 bias 污染、评测是否真实反映理解能力**。\n\n- [[Paper/raw/d-code-scaling-image-pretrained-vlms-to-video-via-dynamic-compression-and/D-CoDe Scaling Image-Pretrained VLMs to Video via Dynamic Compression and Question Decomposition.md|D-CoDe question decomposition]] 🟢◑：把复杂问题拆成 sub-questions，证明 EgoSchema 类任务不只是 perception bottleneck，还有 evidence consumption / reasoning bottleneck。\n- [[Paper/raw/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering.md|C2R]] 🟡◑：base answer/confidence → sub-QA → refined candidates → confidence selector；重点是 sub-QA 有风险，不能盲目信任。\n- [[Paper/raw/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest.md|BOLD / Addressing Blind Guessing]] 🟢：诊断 Video MCQA 的 option selection bias，并用 prior calibration 做 post-processing。\n- [[Paper/raw/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders.md|Video-MME-v2]]：用 group-based non-linear evaluation 惩罚孤立猜中，强调 consistency / coherence。\n- [[Paper/视频理解/选项偏置（Option、Position、Selection Bias）相关论文综述.md|选项偏置综述]]：整理 option / position / selection bias 相关工作。\n\n**关键判断**：\n1. MCQA 提升必须排除 option-position bias、answer extraction 差异、prompt 格式变化。\n2. 对 long-form VideoQA，最好按问题类型、证据跨度、字幕依赖、选项干扰强度分桶。\n3. “模型看到了证据”不等于“模型会用证据”。D-CoDe / C2R / HiCrew / DVD 都在不同层面说明这一点。","x":710,"y":3930,"width":1080,"height":800,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"reading_order","type":"text","text":"# 推荐阅读顺序\n\n## 快速建立背景\n1. [[Paper/raw/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language/video-chatgpt-towards-detailed-video-understanding-via-large-vision-and-language.md|Video-ChatGPT]]：早期 Video-LLM 架构/数据。\n2. [[Paper/raw/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders.md|Video-MME-v2]]：新一代评测为什么更难。\n\n## 核心 baseline：image-VLM → video adaptation\n3. [[Paper/raw/beyond-training-dynamic-token-merging-for-zero-shot-video-understanding/Beyond Training Dynamic Token Merging for Zero-Shot Video Understanding.md|DyTo]]：dynamic token merging。\n4. [[Paper/raw/ktv-keyframes-and-key-tokens-selection-for-efficient-training-free-video-llms/KTV Keyframes and Key Tokens Selection for Efficient Training-Free Video LLMs.md|KTV]]：keyframes + key tokens。\n5. [[Paper/raw/d-code-scaling-image-pretrained-vlms-to-video-via-dynamic-compression-and/D-CoDe Scaling Image-Pretrained VLMs to Video via Dynamic Compression and Question Decomposition.md|D-CoDe]]：compression + decomposition。\n\n## Query-aware selection 族\n6. [[Paper/raw/divide-then-ground-adapting-frame-selection-to-query-types-for-long-form-video/Divide, then Ground Adapting Frame Selection to Query Types for Long-Form Video Understanding.md|DIG]]：global/local query route。\n7. [[Paper/raw/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll.md|Q-Frame]] / [[Paper/raw/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding.md|CoSeLECT]] / [[Paper/raw/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video.md|WFS-SB]] / [[Paper/raw/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question.md|A.I.R.]]：不同 query-aware selector 设计。\n8. [[Paper/raw/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering.md|HiMu]] / [[Paper/raw/a-training-free-framework-for-long-video-understanding-via-video-query-options-s/a-training-free-framework-for-long-video-understanding-via-video-query-options-s.md|VQOS]]：多模态逻辑和 option-aware 证据。\n\n## 内部/外部上限\n9. [[Paper/raw/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding.md|VideoRouter]] / [[Paper/raw/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis.md|FlexMem]] / [[Paper/raw/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video.md|XComp]]：内部 routing/memory/compression。\n10. [[Paper/raw/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid.md|VideoTree]] / [[Paper/raw/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand.md|DVD]] / [[Paper/raw/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question.md|HiCrew]]：外部表示、RAG、agent。\n\n## 鲁棒性和评测\n11. [[Paper/raw/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest.md|BOLD]] / [[Paper/raw/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering.md|C2R]] / [[Paper/视频理解/选项偏置（Option、Position、Selection Bias）相关论文综述.md|选项偏置综述]]：排除 MCQA bias，评估推理稳定性。","x":2580,"y":3310,"width":1120,"height":850,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cat_frame","type":"text","text":"# 1. 时间结构处理：Frame / Segment / Evidence Selection\n\n这一层回答：**哪些时间点或片段值得进入后续模型？** 优点是便宜、可插拔；最大风险是 early discard——关键帧一旦被丢掉，后面很难恢复。\n\n## 1.1 Coverage / representative first\n- [[Paper/raw/adaptive-keyframe-sampling-for-long-video-understanding/adaptive-keyframe-sampling-for-long-video-understanding.md|AKS]] 🟢⭐：relevance + coverage 自适应二分，在 TOP 与 BIN 之间折中。\n- [[Paper/raw/mdp3-a-training-free-approach-for-list-wise-frame-selection-in-video-llms/mdp3-a-training-free-approach-for-list-wise-frame-selection-in-video-llms.md|mDP3]] 🟢⭐：CMGK + DPP + dynamic programming，同时追求 query relevance、list-wise diversity、sequentiality。\n- [[Paper/raw/ktv-keyframes-and-key-tokens-selection-for-efficient-training-free-video-llms/KTV Keyframes and Key Tokens Selection for Efficient Training-Free Video LLMs.md|KTV stage 1]] 🟢⚪：DINOv2 KMeans 选代表性 keyframes，刻意避免纯 CLIP(Q, frame) 的 semantic trap。\n- [[Paper/raw/beyond-training-dynamic-token-merging-for-zero-shot-video-understanding/Beyond Training Dynamic Token Merging for Zero-Shot Video Understanding.md|DyTo stage 1]] 🟢⚪：hierarchical / `[CLS]` 聚类，先做内容驱动的时间压缩。\n\n## 1.2 Query-aware localized selection\n- [[Paper/raw/divide-then-ground-adapting-frame-selection-to-query-types-for-long-form-video/Divide, then Ground Adapting Frame Selection to Query Types for Long-Form Video Understanding.md|DIG]] 🟢⭐：先分 Global Query / Localized Query；global 用 uniform，localized 才做 query-aware grounding。\n- [[Paper/raw/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll.md|Q-Frame]] 🟢⭐：Cross-modal Query Retrieval + Gumbel-Max 选帧 + multi-resolution。\n- [[Paper/raw/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding.md|CoSeLECT]] 🟢⭐：frame-query relevance + visual continuity，先切 subclip 再分配预算。\n- [[Paper/raw/focus-efficient-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding/focus-efficient-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding.md|FOCUS]] 🟢⭐：把 keyframe selection 建模为 CPE multi-armed bandit。\n- [[Paper/raw/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video.md|WFS-SB]] 🟢⭐：把 query-frame relevance 当时间信号，用 wavelet 找 semantic boundary，再 MMR 选帧。\n- [[Paper/raw/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question.md|A.I.R.]] 🟢⭐：CLIP 粗筛 + VLM reasoning relevance + iterative interval refinement。\n\n## 1.3 结构化 / 多模态 / option-aware evidence\n- [[Paper/raw/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering.md|HiMu]] 🟢⭐：把问题解析成 logic tree，路由到 CLIP/OVD/OCR/ASR/CLAP 等专家，再组合 satisfaction curve。\n- [[Paper/raw/a-training-free-framework-for-long-video-understanding-via-video-query-options-s/a-training-free-framework-for-long-video-understanding-via-video-query-options-s.md|VQOS / Video-Query-Options Similarity]] 🟢⭐：利用 question + options statements 检索验证片段，贴近 MCQA 的 option-as-hypothesis。\n- [[Paper/raw/logic-in-frames-dynamic-keyframe-search-via-visual-semantic-logical-verification/logic-in-frames-dynamic-keyframe-search-via-visual-semantic-logical-verification.md|Logic-in-Frames]] 🟢⭐：解析 key/cue objects 与时空/因果关系，用逻辑约束动态搜索关键帧。\n- [[Paper/raw/where-to-focus-query-modulated-multimodal-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-unde/where-to-focus-query-modulated-multimodal-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-unde.md|Q-Gate]] 🟢⭐：LLM Gater 在 Visual Grounding / Global Matching / Contextual Alignment 三个 stream 间动态加权。\n\n## 1.4 训练式 selector\n- [[Paper/raw/m-llm-based-video-frame-selection-for-efficient-video-understanding/m-llm-based-video-frame-selection-for-efficient-video-understanding.md|M-LLM Based Frame Selector]] 🟡⭐：用 Qwen2-VL/GPT-4o mini pseudo-label 训练轻量 selector。\n- [[Paper/raw/query-conditioned-evidential-keyframe-sampling-for-mllm-based-long-form-video-un/query-conditioned-evidential-keyframe-sampling-for-mllm-based-long-form-video-un.md|Query-Conditioned Evidential Sampling]] 🟡⭐：用 conditional mutual information / evidence scoring network 学习证据帧。\n- [[Paper/raw/k-frames-scene-driven-any-k-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding/k-frames-scene-driven-any-k-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding.md|K-frames]] 🔴⭐：scene-driven clip2frame，SFT + RL 对 key-clip selection 做 downstream alignment。\n\n**核心判断**：Query-aware 不应无脑提前使用。更稳的策略是 **先保持时间覆盖/多样性，再在 evidence routing 或 token budget 层做 query/option-aware 聚焦**。","x":-5810,"y":845,"width":1120,"height":1100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pipeline","type":"text","text":"# 统一 Pipeline：论文放在系统哪个位置？\n\n```text\nA 原始视频/音频/字幕/OCR\n  → B 时间结构处理：采样、切分、选帧、选 segment\n  → C 多模态特征/语义抽取：CLIP/DINO/SigLIP/ASR/OCR/caption/database\n  → D 输入侧 visual token 压缩：pruning/merging/allocation\n  → E VLM 内部编码/记忆/路由：attention、KV cache、early layers、memory\n  → F 外部上下文组织：caption tree、RAG、agent tools、frame inspect\n  → G 推理与答案生成：decomposition、multi-path、confidence、calibration\n  → H 评测与数据协议：benchmark、bias、consistency/coherence\n```\n\n**关键区分**：选帧决定“看哪些时间点”；token 压缩决定“每个时间点保留多少空间细节”；外部表示决定“如何把视频组织成可检索证据”；推理/评测决定“答案是否可靠”。","x":-1360,"y":-2230,"width":920,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cat_internal","type":"text","text":"# 3. VLM 内部 / 半内部压缩、记忆与路由\n\n这一层已经进入 VLM forward：使用 early layers、attention、KV cache 或 layer-wise compression。上限高，但通常不适合黑盒 API，工程复杂。\n\n- [[Paper/raw/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding.md|VideoRouter]] 🔴⭐：把 long-video compression 表述为 **budgeted evidence allocation**。Semantic Router 预测 Global / Fragment policy；Image Router 用 early LLM layers 做 frame relevance；再按 query 分配 frame-level token budget。\n- [[Paper/raw/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis.md|FlexMem]] 🟡◑：把 visual KV caches 作为可写入、可回忆的视觉记忆；clip-by-clip watching，最后按 query 读取 memory。\n- [[Paper/raw/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video.md|XComp / One Token per Highly Selective Frame]] 🔴⭐：LP-Comp 逐层 progressive compression，QC-Comp 用内部 attention 做 question-conditioned frame compression，目标接近 one token per frame。\n- [[Paper/raw/dycoke-dynamic-compression-of-tokens-for-fast-video-large-language-models/dycoke-dynamic-compression-of-tokens-for-fast-video-large-language-models.md|DyCoke]] 也有内部 KV cache 动态 pruning / recall 成分，可横跨 D/E 层。\n\n**和外部方法的区别**：\n- 外部 selector：容易迁移、便宜，但只能用浅层语义信号。\n- 内部 router/memory：更贴近模型真正使用的信息，但需要改 forward / 训练 / 访问 hidden states。\n\n**适合怎么引用**：如果你的方法是 training-free 外部 evidence router，VideoRouter/XComp/FlexMem 是“内部上限或相邻路线”，不是直接同类黑盒 baseline。","x":2000,"y":-2360,"width":1020,"height":580,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cat_token","type":"text","text":"# 2. 输入侧 Visual Token 压缩 / Image-VLM → Video Adaptation\n\n这一层回答：**选出的帧进入 vision encoder 后产生太多 visual tokens，怎样在进入 LLM 前剪枝、合并、分配预算？**\n\n## 2.1 核心 training-free adaptation baseline\n- [[Paper/raw/beyond-training-dynamic-token-merging-for-zero-shot-video-understanding/Beyond Training Dynamic Token Merging for Zero-Shot Video Understanding.md|DyTo]] 🟢⚪：hierarchical frame selection + dynamic bipartite token merging；强项是 zero-shot video understanding 的动态压缩基线。\n- [[Paper/raw/ktv-keyframes-and-key-tokens-selection-for-efficient-training-free-video-llms/KTV Keyframes and Key Tokens Selection for Efficient Training-Free Video LLMs.md|KTV]] 🟢⚪/◑：question-agnostic keyframes + key tokens；importance + redundancy score；token 极省，效率/精度 Pareto 很好。\n- [[Paper/raw/d-code-scaling-image-pretrained-vlms-to-video-via-dynamic-compression-and/D-CoDe Scaling Image-Pretrained VLMs to Video via Dynamic Compression and Question Decomposition.md|D-CoDe]] 🟢◑：representative frame selection + spatial token aggregation + question decomposition；说明 compression 和 reasoning organization 可以组合。\n\n## 2.2 Query-adaptive / static-dynamic / budget allocation\n- [[Paper/raw/static-or-dynamic-towards-query-adaptive-token-selection-for-video-question/static-or-dynamic-towards-query-adaptive-token-selection-for-video-question.md|Static or Dynamic / Explore-then-Select]] 🟢⭐：不同问题需要 static key-frame 信息或 dynamic delta-frame 信息，先探索多种配比再选择。\n- [[Paper/raw/longvu-spatiotemporal-adaptive-compression-for-long-video-language-understanding/longvu-spatiotemporal-adaptive-compression-for-long-video-language-understanding.md|LongVU]] 🔴/🟡⭐：DINOv2 temporal reduction + query-aware high-res frame selection + STC；效果强但训练成本高。\n- [[Paper/raw/storm-token-efficient-long-video-understanding-for-multimodal-llms/storm-token-efficient-long-video-understanding-for-multimodal-llms.md|STORM]] 🔴/🟡：Mamba-based temporal projector + pooling/sampling，让 token 在进入 LLM 前已聚合时序。\n\n## 2.3 Token pruning / merging / redundancy compression\n- [[Paper/raw/prunevid-visual-token-pruning-for-efficient-video-large-language-models/prunevid-visual-token-pruning-for-efficient-video-large-language-models.md|PruneVid]] 🟢⭐：static token merge + DPC-KNN + LLM 中间层 question-to-video attention pruning。\n- [[Paper/raw/dycoke-dynamic-compression-of-tokens-for-fast-video-large-language-models/dycoke-dynamic-compression-of-tokens-for-fast-video-large-language-models.md|DyCoke]] 🟢◑：prefilling TTM 合并跨帧冗余，decoding 动态 KV cache pruning / recall。\n- [[Paper/raw/floc-facility-location-based-efficient-visual-token-compression-for-long-video/floc-facility-location-based-efficient-visual-token-compression-for-long-video.md|FLoC]] 🟢⚪：facility location function 选择 representative + diverse token subset。\n- [[Paper/raw/surge-surprise-guided-token-reduction-for-efficient-video-understanding-with-vlm/surge-surprise-guided-token-reduction-for-efficient-video-understanding-with-vlm.md|SURGE]] 🟢◑：用时间可预测性定义 surprise，优先保留难以由历史预测的 patch。\n\n**核心判断**：这类方法不等于“选帧”。它们更关心空间 token / visual token cost。最好的组合通常是：先有 coverage-oriented sampling，再做 token pruning/merging/allocation。","x":3440,"y":-1280,"width":1120,"height":820,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"matrix","type":"text","text":"# 横向矩阵：路线、对象、适用场景、风险\n\n## Route A：Frame / Segment Selection\n代表：[[Paper/raw/divide-then-ground-adapting-frame-selection-to-query-types-for-long-form-video/Divide, then Ground Adapting Frame Selection to Query Types for Long-Form Video Understanding.md|DIG]]、[[Paper/raw/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll/q-frame-query-aware-frame-selection-and-multi-resolution-adaptation-for-video-ll.md|Q-Frame]]、[[Paper/raw/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding/coselect-adaptive-frame-selection-for-video-language-understanding.md|CoSeLECT]]、[[Paper/raw/focus-efficient-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding/focus-efficient-keyframe-selection-for-long-video-understanding.md|FOCUS]]、[[Paper/raw/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video/wavelet-based-frame-selection-by-detecting-semantic-boundary-for-long-video.md|WFS-SB]]、[[Paper/raw/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question/a-i-r-adaptive-iterative-and-reasoning-based-frame-selection-for-video-question.md|A.I.R.]]、[[Paper/raw/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering/himu-hierarchical-multimodal-frame-selection-for-long-video-question-answering.md|HiMu]]。  \n对象：时间点/片段。  \n优势：黑盒友好、成本低。  \n风险：early discard。\n\n## Route B：Frame + Token Compression\n代表：[[Paper/raw/ktv-keyframes-and-key-tokens-selection-for-efficient-training-free-video-llms/KTV Keyframes and Key Tokens Selection for Efficient Training-Free Video LLMs.md|KTV]]、[[Paper/raw/beyond-training-dynamic-token-merging-for-zero-shot-video-understanding/Beyond Training Dynamic Token Merging for Zero-Shot Video Understanding.md|DyTo]]、[[Paper/raw/d-code-scaling-image-pretrained-vlms-to-video-via-dynamic-compression-and/D-CoDe Scaling Image-Pretrained VLMs to Video via Dynamic Compression and Question Decomposition.md|D-CoDe]]、[[Paper/raw/longvu-spatiotemporal-adaptive-compression-for-long-video-language-understanding/longvu-spatiotemporal-adaptive-compression-for-long-video-language-understanding.md|LongVU]]、[[Paper/raw/prunevid-visual-token-pruning-for-efficient-video-large-language-models/prunevid-visual-token-pruning-for-efficient-video-large-language-models.md|PruneVid]]、[[Paper/raw/floc-facility-location-based-efficient-visual-token-compression-for-long-video/floc-facility-location-based-efficient-visual-token-compression-for-long-video.md|FLoC]]。  \n对象：帧 + patch/visual tokens。  \n优势：效率/精度 Pareto。  \n风险：需要访问 features/tokens，可能丢 OCR/小物体/细粒度状态。\n\n## Route C：Query-adaptive Budget / Internal Mechanism\n代表：[[Paper/raw/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding/videorouter-query-adaptive-dual-routing-for-efficient-long-video-understanding.md|VideoRouter]]、[[Paper/raw/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis/scaling-the-long-video-understanding-of-multimodal-large-language-models-via-vis.md|FlexMem]]、[[Paper/raw/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video/one-token-per-highly-selective-frame-towards-extreme-compression-for-long-video.md|XComp]]、[[Paper/raw/static-or-dynamic-towards-query-adaptive-token-selection-for-video-question/static-or-dynamic-towards-query-adaptive-token-selection-for-video-question.md|Static or Dynamic]]。  \n对象：token budget、KV cache、layer-wise tokens。  \n优势：更贴近模型内部使用信息。  \n风险：不黑盒，训练/工程成本高。\n\n## Route D：External Representation / Agent\n代表：[[Paper/raw/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid/videotree-adaptive-tree-based-video-representation-for-llm-reasoning-on-long-vid.md|VideoTree]]、[[Paper/raw/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand/deep-video-discovery-agentic-search-with-tool-use-for-long-form-video-understand.md|DVD]]、[[Paper/raw/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question/hicrew-hierarchical-reasoning-for-long-form-video-understanding-via-question.md|HiCrew]]、[[Paper/raw/threading-keyframe-with-narratives-mllms-as-strong-long-video-comprehenders/threading-keyframe-with-narratives-mllms-as-strong-long-video-comprehenders.md|Nar-KFC]]。  \n对象：caption/tree/database/tool context。  \n优势：适合超长视频和证据链。  \n风险：caption bottleneck、agent 不稳定。\n\n## Route E：Reasoning / Calibration / Evaluation\n代表：[[Paper/raw/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering/confidence-guided-refinement-reasoning-for-zero-shot-question-answering.md|C2R]]、[[Paper/raw/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest/addressing-blind-guessing-calibration-of-selection-bias-in-multiple-choice-quest.md|BOLD]]、[[Paper/raw/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders/video-mme-v2-towards-the-next-stage-in-benchmarks-for-comprehensive-video-unders.md|Video-MME-v2]]。  \n对象：answer candidates、option prior、benchmark group。  \n优势：提升答案稳定性，排除虚假提升。  \n风险：不解决视觉证据缺失。","x":1370,"y":185,"width":1140,"height":1110,"color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e_pipeline_central","fromNode":"pipeline","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"central","toSide":"top","label":"统一框架"},
